  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{As}_2 \\mathrm{~S}_3$ and $\\mathrm{As}_2 \\mathrm{~S}_5$ are yellow colour sulphides, $\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_4\\right)_2 \\mathrm{~S}$ is colourless, PbS is black, CuS is black in colour",
